This project analyzes source code written against DevExpress eXpressApp
Framework (XAF). It is an independent community project: it is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or supported by Developer Express Inc.

XAFLogicExplainer contains no DevExpress source code and requires no DevExpress
license to build or run. It reads the C# and .xafml files in *your* project as
text, using Roslyn's syntax analysis, and never links against DevExpress
assemblies.

The optional ground-truth catalog generator (tools/XafLogicExplainer.DxCatalog)
reads a local DevExpress installation that you already license, and writes its
output outside this repository. No catalog derived from DevExpress sources is
distributed here.

"DevExpress", "XAF" and "eXpressApp Framework" are trademarks of
Developer Express Inc.
